2. Team Workflow (Very Important)

Team mein developers generally Git Branching Workflow follow karte hain.

Standard Team Workflow
Main Branch: Stable production code.
Feature Branch: Apna assigned task implement karna.
Pull Request (PR): Team se code review karwana.
Code Review: Team members se code check karwana.
Merge into Main: Approved code ko main branch mein merge karna.
