8. Practical Team Project

Sirf theory seekhna enough nahi hai. 2–3 developers ke saath ek real-world project par kaam karo.

Project: Task Management Application

Team Distribution:

Developer 1: React Frontend
Developer 2: Node.js Backend
Developer 3: Database & Authentication
Team Collaboration Workflow
GitHub par repository create karo.
Har developer ko separate tasks assign karo.
Har developer apni feature branch par kaam kare.
Changes commit aur push kare.
Pull Request create kare.
Team members code review karein.
Approved code ko main branch mein merge karo.
Docker Compose se complete application run karo.
Testing aur debugging karo.
Final Goal

In skills ko practically seekhne ke baad tumhein professional software development team mein collaborate karne, code manage karne, APIs integrate karne aur applications deploy karne ki achhi foundation mil jayegi.